<!DOCTYPE task PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Task//EN" "task.dtd">
<task id="UpdatePasswordForNonAdminAndAdminUs-90CE6815" xml:lang="en-us" class="- topic/topic task/task "><title class="- topic/title ">Changing user password</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">Starting with <keyword conkeyref="wh_variables_n4/niagara4.14" class="- topic/keyword "/>, Admin users have two options: a new <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Update
Password</uicontrol> action and a password field editor. For non-admin
users, direct password entering is restricted. If you know the current
Password, you can modify it using the new action <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Update
Password</uicontrol>.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">UserService<indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">User<indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">Authenticator</indexterm></indexterm></indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><taskbody class="- topic/body task/taskbody "><prereq class="- topic/section task/prereq ">You are connected to <keyword conkeyref="wh_variables_n4/Workbench" conref="../reuse/WH_SoftwareVariables_Tridium_N4_0000009934.dita#WHSoftwareVariablesTridium-9A3264AE/Workbench" class="- topic/keyword "/> and station is running.</prereq><context class="- topic/section task/context "/><steps class="- topic/ol task/steps "><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">For non-admin users, expand <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Config</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Services</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">UserService</uicontrol></menucascade>, right-click on the user that you want to edit and
choose <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Property Sheet</uicontrol> from the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Views</uicontrol> menu.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Property Sheet</wintitle> opens.<image placement="break" width="500" href="../graphic/UserpropertySheet.png" class="- topic/image "/></stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">To use the action, do one of the following.</cmd><choices class="- topic/ul task/choices "><choice class="- topic/li task/choice ">Expand user and right-click on <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Authenticator</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Actions</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Update password</uicontrol></menucascade></choice><choice class="- topic/li task/choice ">In the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Property Sheet</uicontrol>, right-click
on the <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Authenticator</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Actions</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Update Password</uicontrol></menucascade>.</choice></choices><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Update Password</wintitle> window opens.<image placement="break" width="500" href="../graphic/UpdatePassword.png" class="- topic/image "/></stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Enter the <parmname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/parmname ">Current Password</parmname> first followed
by the new one, confirm it, then click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">OK</uicontrol>.</cmd><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The password is successfully updated.<note class="- topic/note ">In the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Update Password</uicontrol> action, If the user enters incorrect
password five times in 60 seconds, the action is locked for 5 minutes
and an error message appears.<image placement="break" width="500" href="../graphic/WrongUpdatedpasswordmessage.png" class="- topic/image "/> These parameters are default and you can change
the parameters in the system properties.</note></stepresult></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">For admin users, do one of the following.</cmd><substeps class="- topic/ol task/substeps "><substep class="- topic/li task/substep "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Repeat steps 2 and 3 to use the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Update password</uicontrol> action.</cmd></substep><substep class="- topic/li task/substep "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">To use the password filed editor, in the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Authenticator</uicontrol> property, enter the new <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Password</uicontrol> and confirm it.</cmd></substep></substeps><stepresult class="- topic/itemgroup task/stepresult ">The password updated successfully.</stepresult></step></steps><result class="- topic/section task/result "/><example class="- topic/example "/><postreq class="- topic/section task/postreq "/></taskbody></task>